lock":"b-5a06f5471508744b051d","layer":"original","quote":"并州刺史丁原，遣杨将兵诣硕，为假司马","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":69,"end":87},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-b799b6b36314a90febc3","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-5a06f5471508744b051d","layer":"original","quote":"灵帝末，天下乱，帝以所宠小黄门蹇硕为西园上军校尉〖2〗，军京都，欲以御四方。征天下豪杰，以为偏裨〖3〗；太祖及袁绍等皆为校尉，属之","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-dba8d768022566fbb809","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-5a06f5471508744b051d","layer":"original","quote":"灵帝崩，硕为何进所杀。杨复为进所遣，归本州募兵，得千余人。因留上党，击山贼","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":91,"end":128},{"id":"wudi-q-p012","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b7b24d0a76c82d24c36f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《曹瞒传》曰：“太祖初入尉廨，缮治四门。造五色棒，悬门左右各十余枚。有犯禁者，不避豪强，皆棒杀之。后数月，灵帝爱幸小黄门蹇硕叔父夜行，即杀之。京师敛迹，莫敢犯者。近习宠臣咸疾之，然不能伤。于是共称荐之，故迁为顿丘令。”","attribution":"《曹瞒传》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2f620b459c537adbf4c0","start":0,"end":112}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
